{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 126,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "When the LORD brought back those who returned to Zion, we were like those who dream.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "当耶和华将那些被掳的带回的时候，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "當耶和華將那些被擄的帶回的時候，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "Then our mouth was filled with laughter, and our tongue with singing. Then they said among the nations, The LORD has done great things for them.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我们满口喜笑、",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我們滿口喜笑、",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "The LORD has done great things for us, and we are glad.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华果然为我们行了大事，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華果然為我們行了大事，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "Restore our fortunes again, LORD, like the streams in the Negev.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华啊，求你使我们被掳的人归回，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華啊，求你使我們被擄的人歸回，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "Those who sow in tears will reap in joy.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "流泪撒种的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "流淚撒種的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "He who goes out weeping, carrying seed for sowing, will certainly come again with joy, carrying his sheaves.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "那带种流泪出去的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "那帶種流淚出去的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}